## AlphanumericValidation

alphanumeric_validation = Must contain only letters and numbers.

## AsciiValidation

ascii_validation = Must contain only ASCII characters.

## CanonicalFormValidation

canonical_form_validation = Must already be in canonical form.

## ContainsValidation

contains_validation = Must contain the substring '{ $substring }'.

## MatchesValidation

matches_validation = Does not match the expected value.

## PatternValidation

pattern_validation = Does not match the required pattern.

## PrefixValidation

prefix_validation = Must start with '{ $prefix }'.

## SuffixValidation

suffix_validation = Must end with '{ $suffix }'.
